event: thinking
data: {"id": "cdaf472a147c4913-thinking-parallel_evidence-1446", "run_id": "cdaf472a147c4913", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod 描述揭示了**关键冲突**：\n\n1.  **Requests (请求)**: `cpu: 5m`，**没有定义 memory requests**。\n2.  **Limits (限制)**: `cpu: 50m`，**memory: 1Pi** (1 Pebibyte，约 1125 Petabytes)。\n\n**分析**：\n调度器在评估资源时，如果没有设置 `requests.memory`，默认会使用 `limits.memory` 作为评估依据。该 Pod 声明了 `1Pi` 的内存限制，而集群中任何节点的总内存（最大约 32 GiB）都远远小于 1Pi。因此，调度器报告“3 Insufficient memory”是完全正确的。\n\n`kubectl top` 不可用，但我们已经不需要它了，因为 Pod 的 YAML 描述已经提供了决定性的证据：**资源请求/限制配置严重异常**。\n\n为了彻底排除其他可能性（例如 PVC 绑定问题），我再次确认一下 Pod YAML 中是否有 Volume 相关定义。从之前的 `kubectl_get_yaml` 结果看，没有定义任何 Vo", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789111537634, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "cdaf472a147c4913-thinking-parallel_evidence-1447", "run_id": "cdaf472a147c4913", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_start", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789111537637, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_97060f11bb9842eba87cf4bf", "tool_sequence": 10}

