data: {"id": "cdaf472a147c4913-thinking-parallel_evidence-2043", "run_id": "cdaf472a147c4913", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具事实，针对 `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的证据分析如下：\n\n### 1. 关键事实 (Facts)\n*   **Pod 状态**：`phase: Pending`，`nodeName: None`，`PodScheduled=False`。\n*   **调度事件 (Events)**：自创建以来持续触发 `FailedScheduling`，最近一次在 29m 前，原因明确为 `3 Insufficient memory` 且 `No preemption victims found`。\n*   **资源配置 (YAML)**：\n    *   `requests.memory`：**未定义**。\n    *   `limits.memory`：**1Pi** (1 Pebibyte，约 1125 PB)。\n    *   `requests.cpu`：5m，`limits.cpu`：50m。\n*   **节点环境**：集群有 3 个节点 (`master`, `node1`, `node2`)，均处于 `Ready` 状态。\n*   **节", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789111546703, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "cdaf472a147c4913-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "cdaf472a147c4913", "seq": 2044, "ts_ms": 1789111554952, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 56.408, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v02", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/cdaf472a147c4913-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "1e87588d8118bd247023827da920b05e194afebf142e0247aed1f6f30fd7b679", "bytes": 2419}, "snapshot_sha256": "8670ab35fd544458a1acd2bd06cbc2ee607ce22a59bc6710759215db6daca472"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "cdaf472a147c4913-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "cdaf472a147c4913", "seq": 2045, "ts_ms": 1789111554953, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "cdaf472a147c4913-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "cdaf472a147c4913", "seq": 2046, "ts_ms": 1789111563918, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.965, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1507, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v02/workload 处于 Pending 状态，持续触发 FailedScheduling 且无节点可满足资源请求 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` | `Warning FailedScheduling 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory.` (fact-59dec83c5df2) | 记录 Pod 持续无法调度的直接失败机制。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `pod.condition` | `PodScheduled: False, Reason: Unschedulable` (fact-6c0d1bcec8a8) | 确认 Pod 因资源评估失败而处于 Unschedulable 状态。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.memory` | `container: app, value: 1Pi` (fact-199ba403403a) | 揭示 Pod 定义中显式申请了 1 PiB 内存，这是导致调度失败的直接原因。 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | `container.resource_limit.memory` | `container: app, value: 1Pi` (fact-d36c1d1f4051) | 确认 Pod 的内存硬限制同样为 1 PiB，进一步排除了调度回退机制的可能性。 |\n| 5 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_status_phase` 为 Pending (fact-3820ad561c48) | 确认 Pod 当前物理运行阶段仍处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n**证据链说明**：\nK8s 事件（#1）明确显示集群中所有节点均因“内存不足”而拒绝调度。K8s 配置数据（#3, #4）证实 Pod 请求并限制了 `1Pi` 内存。这种极端的资源需求与典型的集群容量严重不匹配，直接导致了调度器返回 `Unschedulable`（#2）且 Pod 保持 Pending（#5）的状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置中 memory 请求设置为 1Pi → 调度器评估节点内存无法满足 → 触发 Insufficient memory 拒绝调度 → Pod 持续 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**Pod 资源配置严重超限**。\n事实 #3 和 #4 确凿显示 `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的容器配置了 `1Pi`（1 Pebibyte，约 1125 TiB）的内存请求与限制。这一数值远超任何标准节点的物理容量，直接导致调度器在评估所有 3 个节点时均判定资源不足（`Insufficient memory`），从而触发 `FailedScheduling` 事件并维持 Pod 的 Pending 状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v02/workload 处于 Pending 状态，持续触发 FailedScheduling 且无节点可满足资源请求 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` | `Warning FailedScheduling 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory.` (fact-59dec83c5df2) | 记录 Pod 持续无法调度的直接失败机制。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `pod.condition` | `PodScheduled: False, Reason: Unschedulable` (fact-6c0d1bcec8a8) | 确认 Pod 因资源评估失败而处于 Unschedulable 状态。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.memory` | `container: app, value: 1Pi` (fact-199ba403403a) | 揭示 Pod 定义中显式申请了 1 PiB 内存，这是导致调度失败的直接原因。 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | `container.resource_limit.memory` | `container: app, value: 1Pi` (fact-d36c1d1f4051) | 确认 Pod 的内存硬限制同样为 1 PiB，进一步排除了调度回退机制的可能性。 |\n| 5 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_status_phase` 为 Pending (fact-3820ad561c48) | 确认 Pod 当前物理运行阶段仍处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n**证据链说明**：\nK8s 事件（#1）明确显示集群中所有节点均因“内存不足”而拒绝调度。K8s 配置数据（#3, #4）证实 Pod 请求并限制了 `1Pi` 内存。这种极端的资源需求与典型的集群容量严重不匹配，直接导致了调度器返回 `Unschedulable`（#2）且 Pod 保持 Pending（#5）的状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置中 memory 请求设置为 1Pi → 调度器评估节点内存无法满足 → 触发 Insufficient memory 拒绝调度 → Pod 持续 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**Pod 资源配置严重超限**。\n事实 #3 和 #4 确凿显示 `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的容器配置了 `1Pi`（1 Pebibyte，约 1125 TiB）的内存请求与限制。这一数值远超任何标准节点的物理容量，直接导致调度器在评估所有 3 个节点时均判定资源不足（`Insufficient memory`），从而触发 `FailedScheduling` 事件并维持 Pod 的 Pending 状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "cdaf472a147c4913-final", "run_id": "cdaf472a147c4913", "seq": 2048, "ts_ms": 1789111563929, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v02/workload 处于 Pending 状态，持续触发 FailedScheduling 且无节点可满足资源请求 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` | `Warning FailedScheduling 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory.` (fact-59dec83c5df2) | 记录 Pod 持续无法调度的直接失败机制。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `pod.condition` | `PodScheduled: False, Reason: Unschedulable` (fact-6c0d1bcec8a8) | 确认 Pod 因资源评估失败而处于 Unschedulable 状态。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `container.resource_request.memory` | `container: app, value: 1Pi` (fact-199ba403403a) | 揭示 Pod 定义中显式申请了 1 PiB 内存，这是导致调度失败的直接原因。 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | `container.resource_limit.memory` | `container: app, value: 1Pi` (fact-d36c1d1f4051) | 确认 Pod 的内存硬限制同样为 1 PiB，进一步排除了调度回退机制的可能性。 |\n| 5 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_status_phase` 为 Pending (fact-3820ad561c48) | 确认 Pod 当前物理运行阶段仍处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n**证据链说明**：\nK8s 事件（#1）明确显示集群中所有节点均因“内存不足”而拒绝调度。K8s 配置数据（#3, #4）证实 Pod 请求并限制了 `1Pi` 内存。这种极端的资源需求与典型的集群容量严重不匹配，直接导致了调度器返回 `Unschedulable`（#2）且 Pod 保持 Pending（#5）的状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置中 memory 请求设置为 1Pi → 调度器评估节点内存无法满足 → 触发 Insufficient memory 拒绝调度 → Pod 持续 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**Pod 资源配置严重超限**。\n事实 #3 和 #4 确凿显示 `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的容器配置了 `1Pi`（1 Pebibyte，约 1125 TiB）的内存请求与限制。这一数值远超任何标准节点的物理容量，直接导致调度器在评估所有 3 个节点时均判定资源不足（`Insufficient memory`），从而触发 `FailedScheduling` 事件并维持 Pod 的 Pending 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 11.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 56.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 56.4s (Evidence 48.2s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 77.007, "metrics": {"run_id": "cdaf472a147c4913", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 77.01262927055359, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 77012.62927055359, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 72853.30009460449, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 9352.041721343994, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3888.2129192352295}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 11618.292808532715, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 56407.75537490845, "success": true}, "evidence"